      "kind": "mechanism",
      "text": "factorial(2) calls factorial(1), so three factorial frames now sit on top of main.",
      "justification": "In factorial(2), n > 1 holds, so line 7 calls factorial(1); factorial(3) and factorial(2) are both still waiting in their line 7, and main is waiting in line 13. The run printed enter factorial(1) as line 3, before any result.",
      "sources": [
