      "kind": "mechanism",
      "text": "In factorial(1), n > 1 is false, so r stays 1 and it returns 1.",
      "justification": "Line 6 tests n > 1 with n = 1: false, so line 7 is skipped and r keeps its initial value 1 from line 5; line 8 prints factorial(1) = 1 and line 9 returns r. The run printed factorial(1) = 1 as line 4.",
